sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant React
  participant API
  participant DB as MariaDB
  Client->>React: Choisir les offres et quantites
  React->>API: POST /orders (option_id, quantity, contact, request_key)
  API->>API: Valider contact, session, mode et cle de requete
  API->>DB: BEGIN + lecture coherente des offres (verrou)
  DB-->>API: Disponibilite et prix fiables
  API->>API: Verifier montants ; calculer subtotal, fee, total
  API->>DB: INSERT order + items snapshots + history
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>React: 201 reference et total confirmes
  React-->>Client: Confirmation ; vider le panier apres succes
  Note over API,DB: En cas d'erreur : ROLLBACK, pas de commande partielle
